                        "entry_id": "7b03b62e-ee74-3214-8dde-928e014f3100",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "yogin"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c9af367b-b6f0-45b9-aa95-df7b98957001",
                        "entry_id": "7b03b62e-ee74-3214-8dde-928e014f3100",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "iogui"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3c458465-d6fd-3e07-b2d0-18b3347796ca",
                        "entry_id": "7b03b62e-ee74-3214-8dde-928e014f3100",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sage et ascète hindouiste qui a atteint un haut niveau spirituel, en particulier par la méditation et le yoga."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Hinduism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "992ab1f4-3657-4205-a3bf-030e4b801468",
                                "sense_id": "3c458465-d6fd-3e07-b2d0-18b3347796ca",
                                "text": "Je m'étais enveloppée de serviettes de bain pour avoir l'air plus hindou, j'avais posé mon pied droit sur ma cuisse gauche et je me regardais fixement dans la glace, non avec complaisance mais dans l'espoir d'atteindre l'état supérieur du yogi."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "45964c9e-8b4f-388a-bb1e-2047ab2a4e21",
                        "entry_id": "7b03b62e-ee74-3214-8dde-928e014f3100",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne pratiquant le yoga."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "50c00ce3-a94d-44ed-aeed-eb2c7732d5a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b03b62e-ee74-3214-8dde-928e014f3100",
                        "target_lang_word": "yogi",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "yogi",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                        "entry_id": "53b6e91d-5a60-3fe1-9d0f-c0084c3d0858",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A devotee or adherent of yoga."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f82bdb4-429c-4ee4-a458-b429a79e8ee1",
                                                "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                                "text": "To this day, yogins find that these disciplines, which have measurable physical and neurological effects, evoke a sense of calm, harmony and equanimity that is comparable to the effect of music."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33d0c88d-8f6f-478b-9470-1389db633a5a",
                                                "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                                "text": "There is a special healthy menu, and the yogis can all eat together if they choose, but there's none of the birdseed-and-bulgur-wheat diet of a typical retreat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70a4c3a1-b61e-42a3-a57c-381d3b6b440b",
                                                "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                                "text": "Gurdjieff connects this type of breathing with yogi breathing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85399bc5-6a51-43a3-9fd4-984c643428ca",
                                                "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                                "text": "It's a yogi trick of some sort."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "yogi",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58923b36-8004-3595-b8bd-830849decdd5",
                                        "entry_id": "df3e25d5-6d8b-3b30-98ae-f5d9b8f28701",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To turn (someone) into a yogi; to lead into practicing yoga."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efbf1b61-e07a-4684-bed5-3ecaea761e6c",
                                                "sense_id": "58923b36-8004-3595-b8bd-830849decdd5",
                                                "text": "You do not even need to be psychoanalyzed, Rolfed, estered, altered, gelded, neutered, spayed, fixed, Mooned, acupunctured, meditated, Zenned, massaged, Cayced, yogied, New Aged, astrocharted, holisticized, computerized, megatrended, therapized, androgynized, evangelized, converted, or even, last and least, to be reborn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be22d69a-953c-442b-af5d-e3b516dee2c0",
                                                "sense_id": "58923b36-8004-3595-b8bd-830849decdd5",
                                                "text": "I meet hundreds of people each year who have been New Thoughted, Mind Scienced, Eckankared, Rosicrucianed, l Amed, White Brotherhooded, Scientologied and, yes, even yogied — to the point of mental numbness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e409756a-3a1d-4dcc-82ff-ddccf25b209b",
                                                "sense_id": "58923b36-8004-3595-b8bd-830849decdd5",
                                                "text": "He had followed Larry faithfully for two days, getting yelled at and grieved over and yogied into a pretzel and fucked over by all sorts of weirdoes who seemed to find him a nice object to act on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "yogi",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b9f14b4-7846-3ff4-9058-0217acbc9bb0",
                                        "entry_id": "19c07f90-83a9-39a0-abf1-1dbef2805317",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To persuade someone to give you food or other favors without actually begging."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "775b7e52-1d2b-4d81-8600-b6850693da2d",
                                                "sense_id": "1b9f14b4-7846-3ff4-9058-0217acbc9bb0",
                                                "text": "Ready to do some hiking now that we are through yogi-ing? I asked, grinning at Map Man. The hikers looked up at me quizzically, but Map Man knew yogi-ing meant the good natured way thru-hikers ask for food without actually begging."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b317dd2-a778-421c-a940-812ad53106d8",
                                                "sense_id": "1b9f14b4-7846-3ff4-9058-0217acbc9bb0",
                                                "text": "Late in the afternoon, I came to a shady spot where there was a picnic table—a rare luxury on the trail. As I approached, I saw that there was a peach on top of the table and beneath it a note. Cheryl! We yogied this from day hikers for you. Enjoy! Sam and Helen"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d435d8d6-86db-4989-80f4-52c699b808ef",
                                                "sense_id": "1b9f14b4-7846-3ff4-9058-0217acbc9bb0",
                                                "text": "You can also yogi food from other hikers and tourists. The yogi cannot realistically be counted upon as a primary resupply strategy, but it's reliable for netting a few extra calories during summer months when traveling through popular parks, especially on weekends."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
